entries.english:
Sacrifices a hand, causing you to lose the ability to use shields{{
    if you.race() ~= "Formicid" then
        return " and two-handed weapons"
    end
}}, and to be able to wear one fewer ring.

entries.translation:
牺牲一只手，使你无法使用盾牌{{
    if you.race() ~= "Formicid" then
        return "和双手武器"
    end
}}，并少戴一枚戒指。

entries.english:
It inflicts extra damage on living creatures proportional to your Necromancy
skill.{{
    if you.god() == "Trog" then
        return " Trog prevents you from unleashing this effect.";
    end
}}{{
    if you.is_useless_skill("necromancy") then
        return " Your inability to study Necromancy prevents you from drawing on the full power of this weapon.";
    end
}}

entries.translation:
它对活物造成的额外伤害与你的死灵系魔法技能成正比。{{
    if you.god() == "Trog" then
        return " 特洛戈不允许你释放此效果。";
    end
}}{{
    if you.is_useless_skill("necromancy") then
        return " 你无法学习死灵系魔法，因此不能发挥这件武器的全部威力。";
    end
}}

entries.english:
Congratulations, your character just gained experience by killing this monster!
This will raise some of your skills, making you more deadly.
{{
    if you.god() == "Trog" then
        return "Also, most kills will grant you favour in the eyes of Trog."
    end
}}

entries.translation:
恭喜！你的角色刚刚通过击杀这个怪物获得了经验。经验会提高部分技能，让你更强。
{{
    if you.god() == "Trog" then
        return "另外，多数击杀也会为你赢得特洛戈的神恩。"
    end
}}

干得好！升级总是好事，你会获得更多生命和魔力，有时还能提高力量、智力、敏捷等属性。

{{
    if crawl.hints_type() == "magic" then
        return "升级还让你能够学习更困难的"
               .. "法术。按"
               .. " <w>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</w><tiles>，或在记忆标签中"
               .. "<w>点击</w>法术</tiles>，即可记忆第二个法术。"
    end
}}

那<console>个 $1</console>是一座祭坛。<localtiles>对它按<w>鼠标右键</w></localtiles><nomouse>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</w> 指向祭坛，再按 <w>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</w></nomouse>，可以查看简要说明。

站在祭坛上，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> 或 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w>，可皈依或阅读该神的信息。正式皈依前会要求确认。

{{
    if you.god() == "No God" and crawl.hints_type() == "magic" then
        return "对缺乏经验的塑能师而言，最容易上手的神可能是"
               .. "维胡梅特，不过席夫·穆纳等许多其他神"
               .. "也很合适。"
    end
}}

这是你捡到的第一件防具<console>（“<w>$item[armour]</w>”）</console>。<localtiles>点击可穿上，再点击一次可脱下；对它按<w>鼠标右键</w>可查看更多信息。</localtiles><nomouse>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_WEAR_ARMOUR]</w> 穿上，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_REMOVE_ARMOUR]</w> 脱下。在背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）中可查看属性。</nomouse>

{{
    if you.get_base_mutation_level("horns") > 0 then
        return "注意，因为你长有角，无法佩戴"
               .. "头盔。（按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MUTATIONS]</w> 可查看"
               .. "变异和天生能力列表。）"
    end
}}

entries.english:
You have picked up a book<console> ('<w>$item[book]</w>')</console>. On pickup,
its spells are immediately added to your library. You'll be able to memorise
spells from it via <w>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</w>, and cast them with
<w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</w>.
{{
    if you.god() == "Trog" then
        return "Trog hates it when you memorise or study magic, though!"
    end
}}

entries.translation:
你捡到了一本书<console>（“<w>$item[book]</w>”）</console>。拾取时，其中法术立即加入法术库。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</w> 可记忆法术，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</w> 可施放。
{{
    if you.god() == "Trog" then
        return "但特洛戈憎恶你记忆或研习魔法！"
    end
}}

这是你捡到的第一件武器<console>（“<w>$item[weapon]</w>”）</console>。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_WIELD_WEAPON]</w><localtiles>，或对它按<w>鼠标左键</w></localtiles>即可持用。但要注意，它可能使用与你当前武器不同的技能。在背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）中选择它<localtiles>，或对它按<w>鼠标右键</w></localtiles>，可以查看属性。

{{
    if crawl.hints_type() == "berserk" then
        return "你最好继续使用斧类武器。不过，检查其他斧头的"
               .. "附魔加成也可能值得！"
    end
}}

entries.english:
A lightweight spear, designed for throwing. It will pass through the targets it
hits, potentially hitting all targets in its path until it reaches maximum
range.
{{
    if you.race() == "Kobold" or you.race() == "Spriggan" then
        return "Unfortunately, it is too long and awkward for you to use."
    end
}}

entries.translation:
一种用于投掷的轻矛。它会穿透命中的目标，可能击中路径上所有目标，直到达到最大射程。
{{
    if you.race() == "Kobold" or you.race() == "Spriggan" then
        return "遗憾的是，它对你来说太长、太笨重，无法使用。"
    end
}}

entries.english:
A spire of strangely tenebrous ice, its brittle tendrils reaching skyward like
the fingers of an outstretched hand. {{
    if spells.memorised("rimeblight") then
        return "If only the dying breath of every soul could create such art."
    else
        return "It might even be beautiful if you didn't know the gruesome " ..
               "way it formed."
    end
}}

entries.translation:
一根阴暗得古怪的冰柱，脆弱的冰须像张开的手指般伸向天空。{{
    if spells.memorised("rimeblight") then
        return "但愿每个灵魂临终的气息，都能创造这样的艺术。"
    else
        return "若不知道它的形成过程多么可怕，" ..
               "它或许称得上美丽。"
    end
}}

这株植物的生命已被吸干，但躯体仍然完整。看起来已死去许多{{ if you.branch() == "Crypt" or
you.branch() == "Tomb" or you.branch() == "Zot" then return "个世纪";
else return "年"; end }}。

entries.english:
“But Sigmund turned him about, and he said: ‘What aileth thee, son?
 Shall our life-days never be merry, and our labour never be done?’

 But Sinfiotli said: ‘I have looked, and lo, there is death in the cup.’

 And the song, and the tinkling of harp-strings to the roof-tree winded up;
 And Sigmund was dreamy with wine and the wearing of many a year;
 And the noise and the glee of the people as the sound of the wild woods were
 And the blossoming boughs of the Branstock were the wild trees waving about;

 So he said: ‘Well seen, my fosterling; let the lip then strain it out.’”
    -William Morris, _The Story of Sigurd the Volsung and the Fall of the
Niblungs_. 1891.

Your Invocations skill affects the likelihood that an attempt to use divine
abilities with certain gods will be successful, and often the power of such
abilities.

{{
    if you.race() ~= "Djinni" then
        return "The Invocations skill also affects your magical reserves, " ..
               "but to a lesser degree than the Spellcasting skill. Only the " ..
               "higher contribution is used."
    end
}}

entries.translation:
祈祷技能影响使用某些神祇的神赐能力时的成功率，通常也影响这些能力的威力。

{{
    if you.race() ~= "Djinni" then
        return "祈祷技能也会影响魔力储备，" ..
               "但影响小于施法技能。两种加成中，" ..
               "只采用较高的一项。"
    end
}}

entries.english:
{{
    if you.race() == "Octopode" then
        return "A vicious spike has grown from one of your tentacles, " ..
               "increasing the damage of your extra tentacle attacks."
    else
        return "Monstrous horns or talons have grown from your body, " ..
               "granting a chance of making an extra attack in melee."
    end
}}

entries.translation:
{{
    if you.race() == "Octopode" then
        return "你的一条触手上长出一根凶狠的尖刺，" ..
               "提高了额外触手攻击的伤害。"
    else
        return "你的身体上长出怪异的角或利爪，" ..
               "使你有一定几率在近战中发动额外攻击。"
    end
}}
